{"id":28669,"author":"2BJ","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eIGN : emilizzle / 2BJ\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eDiscord (Name#) : emile#5223\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eTimezone : GMT +9\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eAny previous Ref experience?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eI, unfortunately, do not have any previous ref experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eWhy would you like to join the referee team?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eI would like to join the referee team as I would like help ensure fairness as well as quality to all players who participate in official Avicus events. As an individual who is able to remain unbiased and honest (some may say 'overly' honest) in all situations, I believe I am capable of enforcing rules and providing an enjoyable and fair experience for all players. I, moreover, am familiar with the network rules, how Discord works, have a working mic, as well as a working recording software, and am capable of detecting modifications.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eAre you able to commit to Saturday Tournaments, and occasionally event staff meetings?\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eYes, I will be able to commit to Saturday Tournaments alongside occasional event staff meetings.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eA paragraph or two to tell us something about yourself :\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eI, as a mentioned before, am a highly honest and unbiased individual. I will enforce rules on individuals regardless of who they are if they are found breaking them and will be able to provide evidence for such situations. I am easy going and approachable for the most part and enjoy joking around but am serious in situations in which I need to be. I, furthermore, am an individual open to criticism and feedback and am willing to change if needed. Thank you for your consideration!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eIGN : emilizzle / 2BJ\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eDiscord (Name#) : emile#5223\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69);\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;\"\u003eTimezone : GMT +9\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 16px; line-height: normal; font-family: \u0026quot;.SF UI Text\u0026quot;; color: rgb(69, 69, 69); min-height: 19.1px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: \u0026quot;.SFUIText\u0026quot;; font-size: 16pt;